<title>USA: Mach One says set to qualify for Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Mach One says set to qualify for Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mach One Corp said Friday it was in a position to qualify for listed trading on Nasdaq because its combined assets meet necessary requirements.</p>
<p>The company said it expected to file documentation for &quot;full reporting status&quot; within the next 60 days.</p>
<p>Since November 1994, Mach One shares have traded on the electronic bulletin board.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
